 + ZIP->MHA","DTMO BAH ASCII file BAH-ASCII-2026.zip (bahw26.txt, bahwo26.txt, sorted_zipmha26.txt, mhanames26.txt); includes the TX270 update","https://www.travel.dod.mil/Portals/119/Documents/BAH/BAH_Rates_All_Locations_All_Pay_Grades/ASCII/BAH-ASCII-2026.zip","Effective 1 Jan 2026","DTMO blocks automated downloads; the unmodified DTMO zip was retrieved from the Internet Archive capture of that exact URL (8 Oct 2026). 2027 BAH not released (expected mid-Dec 2026) - blank."],["BAH RC/T (BAH Type II, non-locality)","DoD Military Compensation - 2026 Non-Locality BAH Rates (BAH RC/T with / without dependents)","https://militarypay.defense.gov/Portals/3/Documents/Allowances/BAH/PDF_Non-Locality-BAH-Rates/2026-Non-Locality-BAH-Rates.pdf","Effective 1 Jan 2026","Used for RC orders of 30 days or fewer (DTMO BAH FAQ: https://www.travel.dod.mil/Allowances/Basic-Allowance-for-Housing/FAQ/). 2027 blank."],["FICA","Employee and employer each: Social Security (OASDI) 6.2% up to the wage base + Medicare (HI) 1.45%; basic pay only (BAH, BAS and per diem are not FICA wages).","https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2025/11/03/2025-19763 (2026 base $184,500) \u00b7 https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2026/10/26/2026-21796 (2027 base $192,300) \u00b7 https://www.ssa.gov/news/en/cola/factsheets/2026.html","Wages paid in 2026 / 2027","Wage-base cap not applied per order (only matters on year-to-date wages)."],["GSA CONUS per diem FY2027 (lodging by month + M&IE, by ZIP)","GSA FY2027 Per Diem ZIP code file + FY2027 per diem rates (standard CONUS $113 lodging / $68 M&IE)","https://www.gsa.gov/system/files/FY2027PerDiemZipCode_Validated090126.xlsx \u00b7 https://www.gsa.gov/system/files/FY2027_PerDiemRates_Validated090126.xlsx","Effective 1 Oct 2026 - 30 Sep 2027","OCONUS not included (flag)."],["GSA CONUS per diem FY2026","GSA FY2026 Per Diem ZIP code file + FY2026 master rates (standard $110 / $68)","https://www.gsa.gov/system/files/FY2026_ZipCodeFile.xlsx \u00b7 https://www.gsa.gov/system/files/FY2026_PerDiemMasterRatesFile.xlsx","Effective 1 Oct 2025 - 30 Sep 2026",null],["First / last day M&IE + incidentals","GSA M&IE breakdown: first and last travel day = 75% of M&IE; incidental expenses $5 (all CONUS tiers)","https://www.gsa.gov/travel/plan-a-trip/per-diem-rates/mie-breakdowns","FY2027",null],["POV mileage (privately owned automobile)","GSA FTR POV mileage reimbursement rate: $0.725/mile (JTR uses the same POC rate)","https://www.gsa.gov/travel/plan-a-trip/transportation-airfare-rates-pov-rates/privately-owned-vehicle-pov-mileage-reimbursement","Effective 1 Jan 2026","CY2027 rate not published as of 31 Oct 2026 - blank; 2026 used with a flag."],["HOW TO UPDATE (yearly paste-in)",null,null,null,null],["Basic pay (AF:BD): fill the next year's block - column AG = year, AH = grade (same 27 grades, same order), AI:BD = the 22 DFAS YOS columns. The key in AF fills itself.",null,null,null,null],["RC/T (BF:BJ): year, grade, without deps, with deps from the Non-Locality BAH Rates PDF. BAS (R:T), FICA (V:Y), POV (AA:AB): add a row for the new year.",null,null,null,null],["BAH locality (BL:CQ): paste DTMO bahwYY.txt rows with BM = year, BO = W; bahwoYY.txt rows with BO = WO (MHA in BN, 27 rates in BQ:CQ in DTMO column order).",null,null,null,null],["ZIP table (DM:DU): add a column 'MHA YYYY' / 'PD FYYYYY' (header text matters) or fill the empty 2027 / FY2028 columns; ZIP column must stay sorted A\u2192Z (Data \u203a Sort).",null,null,null,null],["Per diem (CS:DK): paste the GSA ZIP-code file destinations with CT = FY, CU = DestinationID (0 = standard CONUS rate), CY:DJ = Oct\u2026Sep lodging, DK = M&IE.",null,null,null,null],["Nothing else changes: the estimate picks the year from the order START DATE (per diem by federal FY) and falls back to the latest loaded year with an amber flag.",null,null,null,null]],"calcFormulas":{"E_ON":"=AND(SEL_RANK<>\"\",ISNUMBER(X_START),ISNUMBER(SEL_DAYS))","E_BASEGR":"=IFERROR(INDEX(RT_RANKGR,MATCH(TRIM(SEL_RANK),RT_RANK,0)),\"\")","E_GRADE":"=IF(AND(OR(E_BASEGR=\"O-1\",E_BASEGR=\"O-2\",E_BASEGR=\"O-3\"),E_IN_PRIOR=\"YES\"),E_BASEGR&\"E\",E_BASEGR)","E_GIX":"=IFERROR(MATCH(E_GRADE,RT_GRADES,0),\"\")","E_DAYS":"=IF(ISNUMBER(SEL_DAYS),SEL_DAYS,0)","E_REF":"=IF(ISNUMBER(X_START),X_START,TODAY())","E_YR":"=YEAR(E_REF)","E_FYEAR":"=YEAR(E_REF)+IF(MONTH(E_REF)>=10,1,0)","E_YOSY":"=IF(ISNUMBER(E_IN_PEBD),IFERROR(DATEDIF(E_IN_PEBD,E_REF,\"y\"),\"\"),\"\")","E_YOSIX":"=IF(ISNUMBER(E_YOSY),MATCH(E_YOSY,RT_YOSMIN,1),IFERROR(MATCH(E_IN_YOS,RT_YOSLBL,0),\"\"))","E_YOSLBL":"=IF(ISNUMBER(E_YOSIX),INDEX(RT_YOSLBL,E_YOSIX),\"\")","E_BPYR":"=IF(COUNTIFS(RT_BPYEAR,E_YR,RT_BPO20,\">0\")>0,E_YR,SUMPRODUCT(MAX(RT_BPYEAR*(RT_BPO20>0))))","E_BPMO":"=IFERROR(IF(INDEX(RT_BPV,MATCH(E_BPYR&\"|\"&E_GRADE,RT_BPKEY,0),E_YOSIX)>0,INDEX(RT_BPV,MATCH(E_BPYR&\"|\"&E_GRADE,RT_BPKEY,0),E_YOSIX),\"\"),\"\")","E_BASIC":"=IF(AND(E_ON,ISNUMBER(E_BPMO)),ROUND(E_BPMO/30*E_DAYS,2),0)","E_DEPS":"=IF(OR(E_IN_DEPS=\"YES\",E_IN_DEPS=\"NO\"),E_IN_DEPS,\"\")","E_BAHT":"=IF(E_IN_BAHT=\"NONE\",\"NONE\",IF(E_IN_BAHT=\"LOCALITY\",\"LOCALITY\",IF(E_IN_BAHT=\"RC/T\",\"RC/T\",IF(E_DAYS<=30,\"RC/T\",\"LOCALITY\"))))","E_RCYR":"=IF(COUNTIFS(RT_RCYEAR,E_YR,RT_RCWO,\">0\")>0,E_YR,SUMPRODUCT(MAX(RT_RCYEAR*(RT_RCWO>0))))","E_RCMO":"=IFERROR(INDEX(RT_RCV,MATCH(E_RCYR&\"|\"&E_GRADE,RT_RCKEY,0),IF(E_DEPS=\"YES\",2,1))+0,\"\")","E_DZIP":"=IFERROR(IF(LEN(TRIM(E_IN_DZIP&\"\"))=5,VALUE(TRIM(E_IN_DZIP&\"\")),\"\"),\"\")","E_HZIP":"=IFERROR(IF(LEN(TRIM(E_IN_HZIP&\"\"))=5,VALUE(TRIM(E_IN_HZIP&\"\")),\"\"),\"\")","E_BZIP":"=IF(ISNUMBER(E_HZIP),E_HZIP,E_DZIP)","E_BZROW":"=IFERROR(MATCH(E_BZIP,RT_ZIP,1),\"\")","E_BZOK":"=IFERROR(INDEX(RT_ZIP,E_BZROW)=E_BZIP,FALSE)","E_BHYR":"=IF(COUNTIFS(RT_BHYEAR,E_YR,RT_BHE1,\">0\")>0,E_YR,SUMPRODUCT(MAX(RT_BHYEAR*(RT_BHE1>0))))","E_MHA":"=IF(E_BZOK,IFERROR(INDEX(RT_ZTAB,E_BZROW,MATCH(\"MHA \"&E_BHYR,RT_ZHDR,0))&\"\",\"\"),\"\")","E_MHANAME":"=IF(E_MHA=\"\",\"\",IFERROR(INDEX(RT_BHNAME,MATCH(E_BHYR&\"|\"&E_MHA&\"|W\",RT_BHKEY,0)),\"\"))","E_LOCMO":"=IFERROR(INDEX(RT_BHV,MATCH(E_BHYR&\"|\"&E_MHA&\"|\"&IF(E_DEPS=\"YES\",\"W\",\"WO\"),RT_BHKEY,0),E_GIX)+0,\"\")","E_BAHMO":"=IF(E_BAHT=\"NONE\",0,IF(E_BAHT=\"RC/T\",E_RCMO,E_LOCMO))","E_BAH":"=IF(AND(E_ON,E_DEPS<>\"\",ISNUMBER(E_BAHMO)),ROUND(E_BAHMO/30*E_DAYS,2),0)","E_BASYR":"=IF(COUNTIFS(RT_BASY,E_YR,RT_BASE,\">0\")>0,E_YR,SUMPRODUCT(MAX(RT_BASY*(RT_BASE>0))))","E_BASMO":"=IFERROR(INDEX(IF(LEFT(E_GRADE,1)=\"E\",RT_BASE,RT_BASO),MATCH(E_BASYR,RT_BASY,0))+0,\"\")","E_BAS":"=IF(AND(E_ON,E_GRADE<>\"\",ISNUMBER(E_BASMO)),ROUND(E_BASMO/30*E_DAYS,2),0)","E_FYR":"=IF(COUNTIFS(RT_FY,E_YR,RT_FSS,\">0\")>0,E_YR,SUMPRODUCT(MAX(RT_FY*(RT_FSS>0))))","E_FICAR":"=IFERROR(INDEX(RT_FSS,MATCH(E_FYR,RT_FY,0))+INDEX(RT_FMED,MATCH(E_FYR,RT_FY,0)),0)","E_FICA_EE":"=ROUND(E_BASIC*E_FICAR,2)","E_FICA_ER":"=IF(E_IN_FICAO=\"NONE\",0,ROUND(E_BASIC*E_FICAR,2))","E_PDON":"=IF(E_IN_PD=\"YES\",TRUE,IF(E_IN_PD=\"NO\",FALSE,X_ROUTE_OUT))","E_PDFY":"=IF(COUNTIFS(RT_PDFY,E_FYEAR,RT_PDMIE,\">0\")>0,E_FYEAR,SUMPRODUCT(MAX(RT_PDFY*(RT_PDMIE>0))))","E_DZROW":"=IFERROR(MATCH(E_DZIP,RT_ZIP,1),\"\")","E_DZOK":"=IFERROR(INDEX(RT_ZIP,E_DZROW)=E_DZIP,FALSE)","E_DEST":"=IF(E_DZOK,N(INDEX(RT_ZTAB,E_DZROW,MATCH(\"PD FY\"&E_PDFY,RT_ZHDR,0))),0)","E_MULTI":"=IF(E_DZOK,N(INDEX(RT_ZTAB,E_DZROW,MATCH(\"MULTI FY\"&E_PDFY,RT_ZHDR,0)))=1,FALSE)","E_PDROW":"=IFERROR(MATCH(E_PDFY&\"|\"&E_DEST,RT_PDKEY,0),\"\")","E_PDNAME":"=IF(ISNUMBER(E_PDROW),IF(E_DEST=0,\"Standard CONUS rate\",INDEX(RT_PDNAME,E_PDROW))&IF(INDEX(RT_PDST,E_PDROW)=\"\",\"\",\" \"&INDEX(RT_PDST,E_PDROW)),\"\")","E_LRATE":"=IFERROR(INDEX(RT_PDLODG,E_PDROW,MOD(MONTH(E_REF)-10,12)+1)+0,0)","E_MRATE":"=IFERROR(INDEX(RT_PDMIE,E_PDROW)+0,0)","E_MIED":"=IF(E_IN_MEALP=\"YES\",5.0,E_MRATE)","E_NIGHTS":"=MAX(E_DAYS-1,0)","E_PDOK":"=AND(E_ON,E_PDON,E_DZIP<>\"\")","E_LODG":"=IF(AND(E_PDOK,E_IN_LODGP<>\"YES\"),ROUND(E_NIGHTS*E_LRATE,2),0)","E_MIE":"=IF(E_PDOK,ROUND(IF(E_DAYS=1,0.75*E_MIED,(E_DAYS-2)*E_MIED+2*0.75*E_MIED),2),0)","E_MILES":"=IFERROR(MAX(0,N(E_IN_MILES)),0)","E_POVYR":"=IF(COUNTIFS(RT_POVY,E_YR,RT_POVR,\">0\")>0,E_YR,SUMPRODUCT(MAX(RT_POVY*(RT_POVR>0))))","E_POVR":"=IFERROR(INDEX(RT_POVR,MATCH(E_POVYR,RT_POVY,0))+0,\"\")","E_MILE":"=IF(AND(E_ON,ISNUMBER(E_POVR)),ROUND(E_MILES*E_POVR,2),0)","E_TOTAL":"=IF(E_ON,E_BASIC+E_BAH+E_BAS+E_FICA_ER+E_LODG+E_MIE+E_MILE,0)","E_FLAGS":"=IF(NOT(E_ON),\"Fill RANK, START DATE and NUMBER OF DAYS on the form to start the estimate.\",IF(E_GRADE=\"\",\"\u26a0 No pay grade for this rank. \",\"\")&IF(NOT(ISNUMBER(E_YOSIX)),\"\u26a0 Enter PEBD or pick YEARS OF SERVICE. \",IF(AND(E_GRADE<>\"\",NOT(ISNUMBER(E_BPMO))),\"\u26a0 DFAS has no \"&E_GRADE&\" rate at \"&E_YOSLBL&\". \",\"\"))&IF(E_BPYR<>E_YR,\"\u26a0 \"&E_YR&\" basic pay not published - \"&E_BPYR&\" table used. \",\"\")&IF(E_BASYR<>E_YR,\"\u26a0 \"&E_YR&\" BAS not published - \"&E_BASYR&\" used. \",\"\")&IF(AND(E_BAHT=\"RC/T\",E_RCYR<>E_YR),\"\u26a0 \"&E_YR&\" BAH RC/T not published - \"&E_RCYR&\" used. \",\"\")&IF(AND(E_BAHT=\"LOCALITY\",E_BHYR<>E_YR),\"\u26a0 \"&E_YR&\" BAH not published - \"&E_BHYR&\" used. \",\"\")&IF(AND(E_BAHT<>\"NONE\",E_DEPS=\"\"),\"\u26a0 Pick DEPENDENTS for BAH. \",\"\")&IF(AND(E_BAHT=\"LOCALITY\",E_MHA=\"\"),\"\u26a0 No BAH MHA for ZIP \"&IF(E_BZIP=\"\",\"(blank)\",TEXT(E_BZIP,\"00000\"))&\" - enter a valid home / duty ZIP. \",\"\")&IF(AND(E_BAHT=\"LOCALITY\",NOT(ISNUMBER(E_HZIP)),E_MHA<>\"\"),\"Locality BAH uses the duty ZIP (no home ZIP). \",\"\")&IF(AND(E_PDON,E_DZIP=\"\"),\"\u26a0 Enter the DUTY LOCATION ZIP for per diem. \",\"\")&IF(AND(E_PDOK,E_PDFY<>E_FYEAR),\"\u26a0 FY\"&E_FYEAR&\" per diem not loaded - FY\"&E_PDFY&\" used. \",\"\")&IF(AND(E_PDOK,E_MULTI),\"\u26a0 ZIP spans more than one GSA per diem area - the higher rate is used; check gsa.gov. \",\"\")&IF(AND(E_PDOK,E_DAYS>30),\"Orders over 30 days: JTR long-term TDY (flat-rate) per diem may apply - full rate shown. \",\"\")&IF(E_PDOK,\"Lodging rate = start month; seasonal changes later in the order aren't applied. \",\"\")&IF(AND(E_MILES>0,E_POVYR<>E_YR),\"\u26a0 \"&E_YR&\" POV rate not published - \"&E_POVYR&\" used. \",\"\")&\"OCONUS / COLA / special pays not included.\")","E_ASOF":"=\"RATES AS OF / SOURCE:  Basic pay & BAS - DFAS, eff. 1 Jan \"&E_BPYR&\"  \u00b7  BAH - DTMO \"&IF(E_BAHT=\"RC/T\",E_RCYR&\" Non-Locality (RC/T)\",E_BHYR&\" locality (ZIP\u2192MHA)\")&\", eff. 1 Jan  \u00b7  Per diem - GSA FY\"&E_PDFY&\" (eff. 1 Oct \"&(E_PDFY-1)&\")  \u00b7  FICA - SSA \"&E_FYR&\" (6.2% SS + 1.45% Medicare, basic pay only)  \u00b7  POV - GSA/JTR \"&E_POVYR&\".  URLs + update steps: hidden 'Rates' tab.  ESTIMATE ONLY - finance (DFAS / JTR) determines actual entitlements.\"","E_R_YOS":"=AND(E_ON,E_GRADE<>\"\",NOT(ISNUMBER(E_YOSIX)))","E_R_PEBD":"=AND(ISNUMBER('RFO Form'!C159),NOT(ISNUMBER(E_YOSY)))","E_R_DEPS":"=AND(E_ON,E_BAHT<>\"NONE\",E_DEPS=\"\")","E_R_DZIP":"=OR(AND(E_ON,OR(E_PDON,AND(E_BAHT=\"LOCALITY\",E_HZIP=\"\")),E_DZIP=\"\"),AND(TRIM('RFO Form'!C162&\"\")<>\"\",E_DZIP=\"\"))","E_R_HZIP":"=AND(TRIM('RFO Form'!C163&\"\")<>\"\",E_HZIP=\"\")"},"headers":{"J":"RANK","K":"GRADE","M":"YOS min (completed yrs)","N":"DFAS YOS column","P":"GRADE ORDER","R":"BAS YEAR","S":"ENLISTED $/mo","T":"OFFICER $/mo","V":"FICA YEAR","W":"SOC SEC rate","X":"MEDICARE rate","Y":"SS WAGE BASE","AA":"POV YEAR","AB":"AUTO $/mile"}}